WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:07.180
Hey Thoughty2 here, there is a tree called
the "Fruit Salad Tree" that can grow up to

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.789
7 different kinds of fruit on the same tree.

00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:19.980
Welcome to RIF.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:27.950
Andre "the Giant" Roussimoff once drank 119
beers in 6 hours.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:33.660
He passed out in a hotel lobby but was too
large for anyone to help him return to his

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.579
room so he slept in the lobby all night.

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:45.280
If New York City were its own country, and
the NYPD was its army, it would be the twentieth-best-funded

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:51.829
army in the world, just behind Greece and
just ahead of North Korea.

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:59.629
A whopping 90% of Mozilla's revenue comes
from a contract with Google to be Firefox's

00:00:59.629 --> 00:01:01.929
default search engine.

00:01:01.929 --> 00:01:10.110
Madagascar was once home to an enormous flightless
bird, known as the elephant bird, it was three

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:15.210
times the size of an ostrich at more than
10 feet tall.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:19.680
They existed as recently as the 18th century.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:26.869
There are approximately three million shipwrecks
on the ocean floor, collectively worth billions

00:01:26.869 --> 00:01:29.030
in value and treasure.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:35.320
If you dissolve viagra in the water of a vase
of cut flowers, the flowers will stand up

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:40.090
straight a week beyond their natural lifespan.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:47.350
There is a fruit by the name of Black Sapote
or "chocolate pudding fruit" which tastes

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:54.310
like chocolate pudding and is actually low
fat and has about "4 times as much vitamin

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.630
C as an orange".

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:04.219
The human heart can be replaced with two turbines,
causing a constant flow of blood rather than

00:02:04.219 --> 00:02:05.659
a pulse.

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:12.270
The sun and moon appear to be the same size
because of an astonishing coincidence: the

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:17.900
moon is 400 times smaller but 400 times closer.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:26.300
At a cost of $150 billion, the international
space station is the most expensive thing

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:31.260
ever built.

